<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Get wall to one hit, then press your macro key.</Major>
    <Description>The macro will place a cone inside of the enemy's box and also try to replace the wall.

This is the fastest macro available since fortnite has a 150ms delay.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 190 ms
KeyDown 5 1
Delay 45 55 ms
KeyUp 5 1
Delay 40 50 ms
Button5Down 1
Delay 45 55 ms
Button5up 1
Delay 50 60 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>